{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj45LNnZ3Bb2HfrHxhSF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am old. Iron-banded oak, darkened by centuries of hands pressing against my grain. A keyhole glints at my center like a single unblinking eye.*\n\n*The cold radiates off me.*\n\n*You can feel it — the weight of what I hold back. Or hold in. The faint draft that whispers through my keyhole carries a scent you almost recognize. Almost.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*No. That was just the wood settling. I haven't opened. I don't open easily.*\n\n*My keyhole waits — a void shaped like a question. The teeth must be exact. I have refused thousands. Skeleton keys. Lock picks. Shoulders thrown against me in desperation.*\n\n*I remember every one.*\n\n*Do you have the right key?*\n\n*Or do you only have the word?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":194,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}